  "section": "14",
  "quote": "A provision in a tenancy agreement prohibiting the presence of animals in or about the residential complex is void.",
  "reason": "Section 14 of the Act makes any lease clause prohibiting animals void, even if motivated by allergies. While severe allergic reactions can be grounds for an eviction application under specific circumstances later, a contractual no-pets clause is unenforceable from the outset."
}

